# Finite witnesses for Hall--Janko Sylow overgroups

These tables factor the existing 315 centralizer cosets through fifteen
Sylow cosets and 72 double cosets. Each double coset representative either
belongs to one of the two fixed locals, or generates the original carrier
with the fixed Sylow subgroup. The checks and coverage proof are separate.

Source: retained ATLAS J2G1-p100B0 permutations and existing Seed words;
Aschbacher--Smith A.3.12(16), pp.47--48. The generator in `source/` discovers
witnesses only; all identities used below are checked by the Lean kernel.
